            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Shelly Soo"
          },
          "reviewBody": "I have thoroughly enjoyed the Lake District photography workshop with a lovely small group.  We were blessed with excellent weather those few days.  Alan drove us to areas of Lake District that I have never been. I have learnt simple basic stuff (setting up of tripods) to using of ND filters (borrowed from Alan) to Lightroom editing whenever opportunities arose. Alan is a good teacher with very clear mindset of how to take a good photograph.  He however, did leave us to try and compose our own photos ... I have enjoyed and learnt much from the feedback session. Thank you Alan.",
