            "name": "Customer"
          },
          "reviewBody": "I can't explain how much Alan has improved my photography, my images of today are miles away from what I used to take. I've been on a few of Alan's different offerings from 1-2-1 tuition in Lightroom, weekends away and mentoring sessions. I would recommend all of them.",
